---
import { categories } from '../data/site';
---
<footer class="mt-24 bg-night text-paper">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr_1fr]">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <img src="/images/logo/mark.png" alt="" width="64" height="64" class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 sm:h-16 sm:w-16" />
        <img src="/images/logo/wordmark-tagline-cream.png" alt="Men's Supply House: Equipped for Excellence" width="560" height="124" class="h-auto w-full min-w-0 max-w-[260px]" />
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-sm text-[15px] text-paper/75">Every product here gets used until it shows wear. Each review says how I got it: bought, sent by the brand, or on loan. None of that changes the call.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="display text-xl text-paper/60">Categories</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 grid">{categories.map((c) => <li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm hover:text-paper/70" href={`/${c.slug}/`}>{c.name}</a></li>)}</ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="display text-xl text-paper/60">The counter</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 grid">
        <li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm hover:text-paper/70" href="/field-notes/">Field Notes</a></li>
        <li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm hover:text-paper/70" href="/how-we-test/">How we test</a></li>
        <li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm hover:text-paper/70" href="/about/">About</a></li>
        <li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm hover:text-paper/70" href="/disclosure/">Affiliate disclosure</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="mx-auto max-w-7xl border-t border-paper/15 px-4 py-5 text-xs text-paper/60">Links to retailers may earn a commission. It never changes the call. &copy; Men&rsquo;s Supply House</p>
</footer>
